{"4427790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Total Blade: Mythology", "steam_appid": 4427790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4737280], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Medieval Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead over <strong>3,400 soldiers</strong> in massive real-time medieval battles and conquer the world through warfare, diplomacy, and kingdom management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Progression &amp; Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop both your character and companions through attributes, perks, equipment, and specialized combat builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kingdom Management &amp; Diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer cities, manage resources, recruit foreign lords, and suppress rebellions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Siege &amp; Naval Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besiege mighty fortresses or dominate coastlines through naval combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Historical Companion Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit famous historical figures from around the world as companion heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Adventurers' Guild</strong>, <strong>Mercenary Guild</strong>, or <strong>Criminal Guild</strong>, each offering unique quests, rewards, and progression paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1580s Medieval World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast 1580s world spanning Europe, the Middle East, India, China, Korea, Japan, and the Eurasian Steppe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Treasures &amp; Dungeon Guardians</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful guardians and discover unique artifacts hidden throughout the world's legendary dungeons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Culture-Specific Voices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet characters with voices and speech inspired by their own cultures and backgrounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guilds</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurers' Guild</strong> — Hunt monsters, explore ancient ruins, and recover legendary relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Guild</strong> — Accept military contracts, fight in wars, and earn wealth through battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Criminal Guild</strong> — Build an underground network through smuggling, theft, assassination, and espionage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Factions</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >West</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scotland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >France</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holy Roman Empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iberian Union</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poland–Lithuania</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsardom of Russia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sibir Khanate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >East</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joseon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jurchen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mongol Tümen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taungoo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mughal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ottoman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safavid</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer legendary dungeons and battle culture-specific mythical beasts to obtain unique treasures.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Medieval Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead over <strong>3,400 soldiers</strong> in massive real-time medieval battles and conquer the world through warfare, diplomacy, and kingdom management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Progression &amp; Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop both your character and companions through attributes, perks, equipment, and specialized combat builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kingdom Management &amp; Diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer cities, manage resources, recruit foreign lords, and suppress rebellions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Siege &amp; Naval Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besiege mighty fortresses or dominate coastlines through naval combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Historical Companion Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit famous historical figures from around the world as companion heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guild System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Adventurers' Guild</strong>, <strong>Mercenary Guild</strong>, or <strong>Criminal Guild</strong>, each offering unique quests, rewards, and progression paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1580s Medieval World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast 1580s world spanning Europe, the Middle East, India, China, Korea, Japan, and the Eurasian Steppe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Treasures &amp; Dungeon Guardians</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful guardians and discover unique artifacts hidden throughout the world's legendary dungeons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Culture-Specific Voices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet characters with voices and speech inspired by their own cultures and backgrounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guilds</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurers' Guild</strong> — Hunt monsters, explore ancient ruins, and recover legendary relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenary Guild</strong> — Accept military contracts, fight in wars, and earn wealth through battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Criminal Guild</strong> — Build an underground network through smuggling, theft, assassination, and espionage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Factions</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >West</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scotland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >England</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >France</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holy Roman Empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iberian Union</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poland–Lithuania</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsardom of Russia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sibir Khanate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >East</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joseon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jurchen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mongol Tümen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taungoo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mughal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ottoman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safavid</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mythology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer legendary dungeons and battle culture-specific mythical beasts to obtain unique treasures.</p>", "short_description": "Lead over 3400 soldiers in massive real-time battles across a vast 16th-century world from Europe to Japan. Conquer cities, recruit famous historical figures, and forge your empire in a grand sandbox RPG", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427790/a50cc3dd7757f2aca9eeb4becb1b555e132d0837/header.jpg?t=1786462469", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427790/cdbdd20d638793b0b9198a5f8259cc9824e0a38f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786462469", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427790/cdbdd20d638793b0b9198a5f8259cc9824e0a38f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786462469", 